{"id":1590,"title":"二叉树特性","summary":"二叉树的属性","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a837d403-5c1f-3959-bd7e-24dd82b20d6d","knowledge_id":705,"title":"二叉树的属性","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":705,"title":"二叉树的属性","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"444d3bce-9edc-33e2-9c28-0e993767d90d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"二叉树自然会继承树的基本特征，如一般树的结构和关系。\n\n主要区别在于结点的度数，因为在二叉树中，限制每个结点的最大度数为**2**。\n\n由于这一限制，结点数量与树的高度和层次之间存在着一些有趣的关系。","text_html":"<p>二叉树自然会继承树的基本特征，如一般树的结构和关系。</p>\n<p>主要区别在于结点的度数，因为在二叉树中，限制每个结点的最大度数为<strong>2</strong>。</p>\n<p>由于这一限制，结点数量与树的高度和层次之间存在着一些有趣的关系。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"794d1c3f-5d91-3e09-8f39-aa0c1de8b220","knowledge_id":706,"title":"第一层结点的最大数量","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":706,"title":"第一层结点的最大数量","knowledges":[{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"2aa1a78d-6fa1-3c86-83b5-834a9b676bd5","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/2fc29de9b3d97cf40a07.png","style":"original","caption":"Maximum Number of Nodes at a Level","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":824,"size_in_bytes":51209,"name":"dsa-11.2.1.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e6856531-7e74-37dc-9ba9-fa456b568e39","title":"","title_html":"","text":"二叉树的高度和结点数之间有一种有趣的关系：\n\n- 第**0**层最多有**一**个结点。\n- 第**1**层最多有**两**个结点。\n- 第**2**层最多有**四**个结点，依此类推。\n\n因此，一般来说，第**d**层最多有**（$2^d$）**个结点。\n\n二叉树各层结点的最大数量会随着树的向下延伸而呈指数增长。","text_html":"<p>二叉树的高度和结点数之间有一种有趣的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第<strong>0</strong>层最多有<strong>一</strong>个结点。</li>\n<li>第<strong>1</strong>层最多有<strong>两</strong>个结点。</li>\n<li>第<strong>2</strong>层最多有<strong>四</strong>个结点，依此类推。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此，一般来说，第<strong>d</strong>层最多有<strong>（$2^d$）</strong>个结点。</p>\n<p>二叉树各层结点的最大数量会随着树的向下延伸而呈指数增长。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"73095661-3efe-35c2-a0c1-0a75bae518ed","knowledge_id":707,"title":"特定高度树的最大结点数","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":707,"title":"特定高度树的最大结点数","knowledges":[{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"dcb82cea-e165-3aa4-a55b-8e549eaea091","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/3cbdf7bad9da5799dfc5.png","style":"original","caption":"Maximum Number of Nodes at Given Height","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":824,"size_in_bytes":51752,"name":"dsa-11.2.2.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4425a5b2-0e02-3a9d-ab11-4223680a3949","title":"","title_html":"","text":"一般来说，高度为 **h** 的树最多有(**$2^{h+1}-1$**) 个结点。\n\n请看上图\n\n- 高度为**0**的二叉树只有**1（$2^{0+1}-1$）**个结点（根结点）。\n- 高度为**1**的二叉树最多有**3（$2^{1+1}-1$）**个结点。\n- 高度为 **2** 的二叉树最多有 **7（$2^{2+1}-1$）**个结点，以此类推。","text_html":"<p>一般来说，高度为 <strong>h</strong> 的树最多有(<strong>$2^{h+1}-1$</strong>) 个结点。</p>\n<p>请看上图</p>\n<ul>\n<li>高度为<strong>0</strong>的二叉树只有<strong>1（$2^{0+1}-1$）</strong>个结点（根结点）。</li>\n<li>高度为<strong>1</strong>的二叉树最多有<strong>3（$2^{1+1}-1$）</strong>个结点。</li>\n<li>高度为 <strong>2</strong> 的二叉树最多有 <strong>7（$2^{2+1}-1$）</strong>个结点，以此类推。</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"035","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/035/page/1590"}
